243
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:51,820
Something I could almost grasp, but not quite.

244
00:19:52,300 --> 00:19:54,000
If I could be as powerful as him,

245
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,360
Maybe I would know.

246
00:19:57,920 --> 00:20:00,540
Maybe I could figure out what I needed to about Krona.

247
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:02,020
No way.

248
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:04,900
It's too dangerous to do that without knowing more.

249
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:07,900
If you do this, you could end up as crazy as Krona forever.

250
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,100
Yeah.

251
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,300
I'm sorry, Sol.

252
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,840
I've made up my mind.

253
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:16,440
We can't be sure you'll return to normal.

254
00:20:16,660 --> 00:20:18,840
I know, but it's worth trying, right?

255
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:30,160
All right, fine.

256
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:31,340
I give.

257
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:33,500
Do whatever crazy things you want to.

258
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:36,560
Just remember, no matter how far away you end up,

259
00:20:36,760 --> 00:20:39,180
I'm still your weapon, and I will pull you back.

260
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:39,980
Ow!

261
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,240
Oh, sorry.

262
00:20:43,060 --> 00:20:44,820
You really should lead, okay?

263
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,060
Uh-huh.

264
00:20:46,420 --> 00:20:47,740
I see that now.

265
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:49,960
This is more like it.

266
00:20:54,000 --> 00:21:17,640
Oh, he flew!

267
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:17,660
Oh, he flew!

268
00:21:17,660 --> 00:21:25,820
I'm being pulled into the madness with her!

269
00:21:26,540 --> 00:21:29,600
Maka, I swear I will not let go of you!

270
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,700
You're wrong about that one, fool.

271
00:21:33,180 --> 00:21:35,160
See, I'm the one who's leading now.

272
00:21:35,160 --> 00:22:05,140
Maka, I swear I will not let go of you!

273
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:22,600
Maka, I swear I will not let go of you!

274
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:52,580
Thank you.

275
00:22:52,600 --> 00:23:22,580
Thank you.

276
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:24,440
You could have told me sooner.

277
00:23:24,820 --> 00:23:28,300
On the next episode of Soul Eater, may my soul reach you.

278
00:23:28,660 --> 00:23:31,980
A dry heart inside unbearable isolation.

279
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:34,780
Watch it, or I'll take your soul, mister.

